        "anchor": "our-values",
        "eyebrow": "Our values",
        "heading": "What we will not do",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>Values are only believable when they are written as refusals, so ours are.</p><ul><li><strong>No unnamed concentrations.</strong> If an active is in the formula, its dose is on the carton.</li><li><strong>No invented figures.</strong> Every number carries its panel size, its duration, and whether it was measured or self-reported.</li><li><strong>No borrowed credibility.</strong> No press logos we have not earned, no dermatologist we cannot name, no certification we cannot evidence.</li><li><strong>No pretending to know.</strong> Where the evidence is thin, we say the evidence is thin.</li></ul>",
