        "heading": "The people behind it",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>A small team, and deliberately a specific one.</p><ul><li><strong>Formulation.</strong> Eleven years of contract development across serums, sunscreens and barrier creams.</li><li><strong>Quality and compliance.</strong> Batch records, certificate tracking and INCI verification against every carton before it prints.</li><li><strong>Customer support.</strong> Two people, no chatbot, both able to answer a formulation question without escalating it.</li></ul><p>We do not currently have a dermatologist on staff. Where you see the phrase dermatologist reviewed anywhere on this site, it must name the reviewer and their registration — or it should not be there at all.</p>",
